Error [E0038]: `File.open` is not the M10 file API
  --> tests/ui/foreign_file_open.jet:2:10
    |
  2 |     File.open("data.txt");
    |          ^^^^
 Why: M10 uses whole-file helpers in `std.fs`; file handles are out of scope
 Fix: import `std.fs as fs` and call `fs.read(path)` or `fs.write(path, text)`
